Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 07 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:09.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! It's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:13.56,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.16,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:15.16,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:24.12,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Hi Dai-chan, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.54,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.29,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:33.60,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What happened, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:35.43,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:35.43,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:37.24,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No, we just came to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.84,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:38.85,Overlap,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, do you like sweet buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.23,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're round sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:44.85,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:48.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get some barley tea for Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:50.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Come, Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:52.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We were just about to sit down for snack time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:53.95,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.23,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.08,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.95,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:46.35,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I've never been here before, but it looks just like Grandpa's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:52.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on? Why does she have her knapsack with her on a Sunday? {referring to Reina}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.11,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:58.36,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is... we ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:01.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Won't your family worry about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:02.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:08.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, is it... you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.38,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:12.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, like problems with your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.51,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,There's that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.05,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about your in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:19.89,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,There's that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:26.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's probably tough living with your in-laws, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:31.81,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Does a house even exist in this world where\Nsomeone can live peacefully with their in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's scary!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:37.91,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any siblings, so I have nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:39.67,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:44.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, let's talk things over first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:45.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What did you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:46.09,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:50.16,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I left them a letter, though I didn't say where we were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:53.15,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll take Reina to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.95,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't given much thought beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.95,0:03:57.14,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't even told my parents yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:04:01.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How can you not have thought about it? Your daughter's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:04.01,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I had no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to get out of that house as quickly as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:12.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, how about we go grocery shopping for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.23,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:21.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not much, but you can use the room on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:26.24,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, it's a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:29.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:33.37,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers, textbooks and other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:35.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed you made it all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:42.32,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, you stick to the usual meals, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:44.40,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cook for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't always make the same stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.84,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we go to the sweets section?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Choose one each.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:52.26,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:55.00,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,What meat should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:58.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.39,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,No, not that! This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:02.35,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, this one's no good either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.88,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi-san! Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:12.37,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, this ground beef is really cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holy crap!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:18.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait! This isn't what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is my cousin, Haruko, from my mother's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:24.01,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it matter if I'm from your mother's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:25.69,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:26.83,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:32.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why the hell did I say that?\NShe didn't even ask about her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why did I force myself to explain things to her?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Did I seriously say all that?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.69,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.05,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:43.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What sweets did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.03,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:49.98,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Deluxe Big Nyan Gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.11,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I got a vegetable sponge cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:55.48,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I got Meow Meow Candy with the kitty character!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:00.08,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Are those really all sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:08.53,MainLow,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:14.49,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, I guess she's sort of pretty for a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:18.48,MainLow,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I don't think you should have an affair with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.77,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.64,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:25.29,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, she has it hard enough raising Kouki by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.53,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's got her hands full!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:27.42,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,She's single?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot! Stop watching those weird dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:33.47,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I'd guess she's two to three years older than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:35.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares how old she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:39.28,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,So, is she divorced?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:42.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.00,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It looks yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.14,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.26,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I thought we'd try something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:54.19,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,We normally have to eat whatever my mother-in-law wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:57.89,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, can we have this at home too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:00.85,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.91,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Okay then, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:04.67,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for this meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.15,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.43,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:11.60,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.28,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The floor's creaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.33,Overlap,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, take this towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.50,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:20.06,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,A bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.91,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, Reina! Don't pull on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are they asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.45,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,They were full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.98,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I put Rin-chan on your futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:42.98,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:48.78,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! I haven't had alcohol in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:52.33,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,No, thanks. I put on weight too easily these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:54.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.12,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,So I've really gained weight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I didn't mean you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:07:59.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean in general for people over thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:03.30,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't mind being thirty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.92,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Life's just not the same when you get older, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.77,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,You have to watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:10.85,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Although, it's not like my husband ever looks at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:13.19,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Who am I doing all this for then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:19.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:24.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When you all were in the bath earlier, I called your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.61,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:28.01,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do weird things like that, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:31.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It isn't weird. They must be worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:36.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just told them that the two of you are fine and will be staying at my place for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even give them my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:41.26,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I already left them a letter! Mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:42.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure you're fine, but what about Reina?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:49.78,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's with me and is doing just fine! What's the problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:56.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Still, if you don't tell them where you are or how Reina is doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:09:00.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,how will the people you left behind know if you're okay or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:02.24,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:04.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:06.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is this just about causing trouble for your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:05.56,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:11.95,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:12.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.88,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:24.66,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:30.94,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I always pretend I'm sleeping when they fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.21,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:35.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:37.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.55,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my cheek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:43.56,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:49.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since I got married, I've lived every day of my life with my feelings locked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.79,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Can't I trouble them just once?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.95,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.71,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:06.16,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:14.91,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:33.40,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Good night, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:49.96,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:52.96,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:55.04,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:55.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:59.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You woke up early today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:04.33,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, do you make Rin-chan cook breakfast for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:08.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We always cook together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And when we use the stove, I{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:11.52,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:18.04,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, you've got some rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:21.57,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:24.31,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,We have to take the train to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:27.54,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Who is that? {at this early of the day}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.32,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.54,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:28.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:31.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, already! Just come inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:32.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll wake the neighbors up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.05,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Is your school far, Rin-chan? You're leaving so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:36.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:42.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mom is always busy, so he comes here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.10,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.19,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:50.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way! She's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.07,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I figured you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:55.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:57.57,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, do you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:02.53,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, you're better off single, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "single"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.37,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,When you're not married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:09.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! You mean "divorce"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.41,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:16.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So your mom is married but wants to be single,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,and Daikichi is single but wants to be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.71,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Adults are weird, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:23.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.58,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you have breakfast already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.37,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:33.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:34.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was for me though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:35.99,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.82,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,You really are a soft one, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:43.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? I just gave him a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:46.02,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:49.03,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you just as busy as her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:52.86,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you had a thing for that pretty mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:13:01.67,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought I should give her a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.40,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, Rin likes them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.54,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:08.51,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.35,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I get the feeling the two of them have been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be rude of me to pry into their business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:20.76,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it really is tough being a single mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:26.97,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, didn't I tell you to hurry up and finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:25.95,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:29.17,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.41,Main,Tchr,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.82,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell anyone where we're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.82,0:13:34.58,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.66,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Just don't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:37.63,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:38.83,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.14,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.36,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, did you come with your mom today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:43.84,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:47.38,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,We ran away from home secretly, so we had to take the train today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:50.30,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.82,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,No, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:16.25,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:19.21,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to hold on to it tightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.92,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not getting you another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.92,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it'll be waiting for us at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:29.84,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's true! Maybe it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.89,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:39.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:41.93,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. My husband's at home with our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:43.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How's Yuu-kun doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.18,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.37,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, he's so energetic lately I have a hard time keeping track of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:52.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to hear that your husband's helping out though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.81,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.29,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,His business trip was rescheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:56.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:15:00.77,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I don't think my husband can raise a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.59,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:06.92,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:07.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:26.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're home, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:37.24,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,They slept right away tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, I'm not saying you will,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:41.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but you're not planning on taking this any further, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.79,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean like a divorce or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:48.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.15,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:56.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh, I guess I was worrying over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:59.60,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have thought about it a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:03.47,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I think about it almost every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:08.78,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,If I consider my husband my enemy,\Neven in his{TLC: my? our?} own house, how can I not? {think about it}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.73,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Except for Reina, they're all my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:15.27,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I see our family as only us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:19.65,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,But, I'm not being very realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:23.62,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I have to think of Reina,\Nand whether or not I can earn a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:27.24,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Not to mention all I've had to go through to be where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:33.42,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I guess in the end I'm better off where I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:37.18,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I got married right after I started working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:43.23,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,When I was young, all I thought\Nabout was becoming a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:45.85,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it was inevitable, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.52,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,That's the only way I can watch over Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:52.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never been married, so I can't say for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:55.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but even normal families face problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:58.70,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, you handle everything by yourself. You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:01.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:05.42,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you have. Rin-chan looks so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.62,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Like when she cooks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.55,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Even Kouki-kun and his mom get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:15.17,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Reina and I have to give it our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:17.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You keep talking about just the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:19.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but have you talked to your husband about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:23.89,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,He works overtime a lot, and we never really talk anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:27.66,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Reina and I will do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:31.25,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,We've gone through so much already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.04,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:37.78,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine as long as I don't allow myself to feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:41.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't sound healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:43.70,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! It's just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:48.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've really gotten strong, Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.40,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:55.36,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, giving birth and raising a child means you have to dig deep down for strength, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.61,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Especially when they're still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:02.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know much about raising a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:08.61,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,But after constantly keeping up that lifestyle, it sort of becomes natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.17,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to feel like an old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:15.08,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I wanted to become a stronger person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:21.06,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could stay young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.05,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.13,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:30.24,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,We'll head home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:37.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What does it mean to be married?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What does it mean to be a parent?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:49.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.13,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:52.56,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.52,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.41,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's Papa's car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:59.00,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's coming after he's done with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.85,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,He never gets off this early!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.76,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.61,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm positive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.08,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,It's not him, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:10.57,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.63,Main,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:14.50,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.53,Main,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:21.20,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,So all this time he could have left work if he really needed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard working in a company!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.47,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Hideyuki-san, you dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:30.18,Main,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry. Haruko must have troubled you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:33.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:36.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Crap! I'm not dressed right for this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.81,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for everything, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.87,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Papa could have at least carried our bags, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.48,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,He's not very thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.70,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,He's not totful! {she mispronounces}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:54.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come by again whenever you feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:58.62,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,No way. I can't trouble you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:00.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin always says she wants to see Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.99,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:11.93,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:14.41,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean we can come back on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.35,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:20.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Haruko was always crying when she was a kid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:25.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She said yesterday she wanted to be young forever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:28.12,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about packing lighter next time you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:32.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even want to look at that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:38.29,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,No can do. Girls always have a lot to carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.77,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:40.76,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:42.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll walk you to the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:17.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:19.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:22.17,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, maybe this one fits you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:22.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:25.11,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try this one on too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:26.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:27.85,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.24,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She just has to try these on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:32.98,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my! Isn't this one nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:36.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Kouki and I are gonna walk around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:37.96,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:40.16,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It looks so good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.92,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:39.37,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:48.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:50.13,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.55,0:22:53.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
